OL,3,GNEWSAEx-world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,4,Acharged with GBH
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world champion boxer Liam Smith
OL,7,Fhas been charged with causing grievous
OL,8,Fbodily harm after an alleged attack on
OL,9,Fa night concierge at a luxury
OL,10,FManchester apartment building.
OL,12,FSmith, who held the WBO super
OL,13,Fwelterweight title from 2015 to 2016,
OL,14,Fwas arrested after the man suffered
OL,15,Fserious facial injuries at The Blade on
OL,16,FSilvercroft Street in Deansgate on 13
OL,17,FSeptember, police confirmed.
OL,19,FThe 38-year-old appeared at Manchester
OL,20,FMagistrates Court the following day
OL,21,Fcharged with causing GBH with intent,
OL,22,Fand was released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
